</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.47</h2><ul><li><strong>Copilot&#x27;s usage card can show quota amounts.</strong> Turn on Show quota amounts under Settings → Providers → Copilot and each row on the card also shows the amount, such as 176 / 300; it is off by default. Thanks to <a href="https://github.com/qunqin24/Pulse/pull/118">@lexleizou</a> for the contribution.</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.47">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
